Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "smoke-test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "smoke-test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================================================
### CITIES
