  "name": "Smoke Test City",
  "country": "Jordan"
}

### Requires ManageCities
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/cities/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Smoke City",
  "country": "Jordan"
}

### Requires ManageCities
