### Requires authentication. Put test.jpg beside this .http file.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hotels/1/images
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=HotelImageBoundary

--HotelImageBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test.jpg
--HotelImageBoundary--

### Requires authentication
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/hotels/1/images/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
