GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/1/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Intentionally missing Idempotency-Key; expected 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/1/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Requires CreateBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/1/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: smoke-test-payment-001

### Repeat the same idempotency key
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/1/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: smoke-test-payment-001


